@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Presentation Layer" {
  [Pengguna / Petugas CSIRT] as User
  [Dashboard Web (React 18 / Port 5173)] as Dashboard
}

package "Orchestration & Gateway" {
  [Aggregator Service (Port 3004)] as Aggregator
  database "SQLite Database" as DB
  [SMTP Google Mail Server] as SMTP
}

package "Microservices Worker" {
  [Crawler Service (Port 3001)] as Crawler
  [Text Detection Service (Port 3000)] as TextDet
  [Link Detection Service (Port 3003)] as LinkDet
  [Defacement Service (Port 3002)] as DefDet
}

User <--> Dashboard : HTTP (Port 5173)
Dashboard <--> Aggregator : REST API (JSON)
Aggregator <--> DB : SQL Query (better-sqlite3)
Aggregator --> SMTP : SMTP Port 587 (Nodemailer)

Aggregator <--> Crawler : POST /api/v1/crawl
Aggregator <--> TextDet : POST /api/v1/detect (Aho-Corasick)
Aggregator <--> LinkDet : POST /api/v1/detect (Heuristik)
Aggregator <--> DefDet : POST /api/v1/detect (Baseline Hash)
@enduml
